WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Care coordination is hard. Four hundred patients enrolled.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.000
This is Kate. She is one of them.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.500
She never opens the app.

4
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.000
The device is still in the box.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.500
She takes her medication when she remembers.

6
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.500
Kate is not difficult. Kate is normal.

7
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.000
So your team calls her.

8
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.500
It rings.

9
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.500
Under a blanket. In another room.

10
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.000
And nobody is free to try again.

11
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Everything else still has to be documented well enough to bill.

12
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.000
At the end of the day, Kate has not been reached.
Nobody did anything wrong. There are not enough hours.

13
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.000
So what if every coordinator had assistants?

14
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Your team sets the work once.

15
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:45.500
And AI agents do the groundwork. Every month.

16
00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:49.500
What comes back is documented, ready to bill.

17
00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:53.000
So your coordinators can focus on what matters.

18
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:57.000
HANA Health. Book a call.
